# Prepares the built fixture kobold-rogue-seed1 for the checks that load it (bd inc-10v7f).
# The old fixture, a .sav, held this state: the whip dropped from the Weapon Hand to the floor. A reach weapon
# makes a monster pass a Reflex save to close with its wielder (src/Move.cpp:826-903), and a monster that fails
# stops short of the square it wanted, which is the trapped square; so the checks fight with empty hands.
# Ruling V7-1: a fixture holds only the created character, so the checks that need the state make it here.
@while "more --" SPACE
i                       # Inventory Mode
b                       # Weapon Hand
d                       # Drop the weapon.
@expect "Weapon Hand  :Empty"
ESC                     # leave Inventory Mode, back to play
